// Test: Implicit ⤺ from function
// Spec: 02-SYNTAX.md § 3.2 Return Statements
// Priority: P0
//
// Purpose:
// Validates that functions can ⤺ values implicitly (without ⤺ keyword).
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should compile and print 42

rite get_value() → !i32 {
    42
}

rite main() {
    println(get_value());
}
